  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Job",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 40,
    "summary": "The Lord challenges Job, and Job replies humbly—The Lord speaks of His power to Job—He asks, Hast thou an arm like God?—He points to His power in the behemoth.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Moreover the Lord answered Job, and said,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:1",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Shall he that contendeth with the Almighty instruct him? he that reproveth God, let him answer it.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 56
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:2",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Then Job answered the Lord, and said,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:3",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, I am vile; what shall I answer thee? I will lay mine hand upon my mouth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:4",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Once have I spoken; but I will not answer: yea, twice; but I will proceed no further.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:5",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "Then answered the Lord unto Job out of the whirlwind, and said,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:6",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Gird up thy loins now like a man: I will demand of thee, and declare thou unto me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:7",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Wilt thou also disannul my judgment? wilt thou condemn me, that thou mayest be righteous?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:8",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Hast thou an arm like God? or canst thou thunder with a voice like him?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:9",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Deck thyself now with majesty and excellency; and array thyself with glory and beauty.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 21
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:10",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Cast abroad the rage of thy wrath: and behold every one that is proud, and abase him.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 64,
            "end": 69,
            "text": "Isa. 2:12; 2 Ne. 12:12; 23:11; D&C 64:24."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 56,
            "end": 63
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Isa. 2:12; 2 Ne. 12:12; 23:11; D&C 64:24.",
            "prettyString": "Isaiah 2:12; 2 Nephi 12:12; 23:11; D&C 64:24",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "isaiah",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 2,
                    "end": 2,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 12,
                        "end": 12
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "2nephi",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 12,
                    "end": 12,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 12,
                        "end": 12
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "start": 23,
                    "end": 23,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 11,
                        "end": 11
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "doctrineandcovenants",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 64,
                    "end": 64,
                    "verses": [
