                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:11",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Look on every one that is proud, and bring him low; and tread down the wicked in their place.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 18,
            "end": 25
          },
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 36
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:12",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "Hide them in the dust together; and bind their faces in secret.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 35
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:13",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Then will I also confess unto thee that thine own right hand can save thee.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:14",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold now behemoth, which I made with thee; he eateth grass as an ox.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:15",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "Lo now, his strength is in his loins, and his force is in the navel of his belly.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 21,
            "end": 23
          },
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 54
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:16",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "He moveth his tail like a cedar: the sinews of his stones are wrapped together.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:17",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "His bones are as strong pieces of brass; his bones are like bars of iron.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 16
          },
          {
            "start": 51,
            "end": 54
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:18",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "He is the chief of the ways of God: he that made him can make his sword to approach unto him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 3,
            "end": 5
          },
          {
            "start": 84,
            "end": 93
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:19",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "Surely the mountains bring him forth food, where all the beasts of the field play.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:20",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "He lieth under the shady trees, in the covert of the reed, and fens.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 63,
            "end": 67,
            "text": "HEB in marshes."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:21",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "The shady trees cover him with their shadow; the willows of the brook compass him about.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 30
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:22",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, he drinketh up a river, and hasteth not: he trusteth that he can draw up Jordan into his mouth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 35
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Job 40:23",
        "book": "Job",
        "chapter": 40,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "He taketh it with his eyes: his nose pierceth through snares.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 31
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
